graph TD
    A[Test response received] --> B{Is Edinburgh test?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Structural assertions only<br/>tool_execution_required]
    B -->|No| D[Full deterministic assertions<br/>regex + dot_parse + tool]

    C --> E{Any structural fail?}
